esphome_esp-video — Third-party notices
=======================================

This repository provides ESPHome external components for video capture, camera
sensor drivers and an LVGL camera display on Espressif ESP32 targets (especially
the ESP32-P4), and Portall -- an ESPHome component plus a Home Assistant add-on
that put a rendered web page on an ESP32-P4 panel. In addition to the original
ESPHome integration code (under MIT, see the LICENSE file), it bundles
("vendors") source code and assets from upstream projects. Each part keeps its
own license. See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt for the full Apache License 2.0 text.

